WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:09.970
<v Speaker 1>Hi, Justin. Gary here with Craig Crumples, the reigning U.S. National champion representing the United States at this World Championships. How are you feeling today?</v>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.050
<v Speaker 2>Correct. Real good right now. I'm 30 so it's pretty nice day so far.</v>

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:21.050
<v Speaker 1>Three. And oh, that's an impressive performance representing your country well, I couldn't help but notice that the US didn't seem to be up on the leaderboard there. How are your teammates doing?</v>

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:29.890
<v Speaker 2>Today, actually, Benz right now is 2 in one and they'll just picked up his first point with the draw, so we'll be on the board after this round.</v>

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.990
<v Speaker 1>So as the reigning champion, seems like</v>

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:39.370
<v Speaker 1>it's got to be a lot of pressure on you to perform here. the US is that pretty good? You know, history at the World Championships. Do you think you guys are gonna be able to pull it?</v>

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:48.780
<v Speaker 2>Off on the US always has a real strong team. I I don't feel too much pressure on it. I know my team is going to do the best that they can. I'm gonna do the best that I can and whatever happens, happens.</v>

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:53.460
<v Speaker 1>And who do you see as your biggest competition here this this tournament?</v>

00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:03.780
<v Speaker 2>It's a little early to say that, but there's obviously strong teams out there, the Dutch and the French always going to make a run at it, so we'll see how they're doing later in the tournament.</v>

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:08.710
<v Speaker 1>OK, well, thanks for talking to us. We'll check in on you later. This is Justin Gary from the Magic World Champion.</v>

